{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KMh2rrXakvjSZ5Wb6H7fCN","type":"tool_result","content":"commit bcb1c0d20edde5751afeb27e78481b1a8d1f6758\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Mon Apr 13 18:25:00 2026 +0200\n\n    Batch Round 0 caller-routing: CUDA kernels, FFI, orchestration module\n    \n    Re-introduce batched descriptor-array CUDA kernels for Round 0 zerocheck\n    and logup evaluation (from reverted commit 0c699f47). Key change from the\n    previous attempt: all orchestration logic lives in a new round0_batched.rs\n    module with #[inline(never)], and sumcheck_uni_round0_polys gets only a\n    minimal skip_traces filter parameter.\n    \n    CUDA changes:\n    - Round0ZcCtx/Round0LogupCtx per-AIR descriptor structs\n    - batched_zerocheck_r0_coset_parallel_kernel: 1D grid with BlockCtx mapping\n    - batched_logup_r0_coset_parallel_kernel: same pattern with identity-coset\n    - Extern \"C\" launchers with batched_final_reduce_block_sums reduction\n    \n    Rust changes:\n    - #[repr(C)] FFI structs and safe wrapper functions\n    - New round0_batched.rs module: identify_batchable_airs(), batch_round0_small_airs(),\n      merge_results(), batched group evaluation helpers\n    - Caller routing in prove_zerocheck_and_logup_gpu\n    - Memory budget filter (MAX_INTERMEDIATES_PER_AIR) to prevent OOM\n    - Always allocate intermediates in GLOBAL mode (fixes cudaErrorIllegalAddress)\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .../cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/logup_round0.cu       | 239 +++++++\n .../cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/zerocheck_round0.cu   | 236 +++++++\n crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs    | 141 ++++\n crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs     |  19 +-\n .../src/logup_zerocheck/round0_batched.rs          | 727 +++++++++++++++++++++\n 5 files changed, 1356 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n[rerun: b6]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu